# Where to look

Algorithms: `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`. Dashboard visuals: `docs/DASHBOARD.md`. OSC addresses: `.cursor/rules/02-touchdesigner-osc.mdc` and `docs/OSC_SPEC.md`.

One process (`src/luzifer/main.py`): `Pipeline.run` plus FastAPI on port 8501. Live settings are `ConfigStore` in `config.py`. Schema is `AppSettings`. Persisted copy is `config.yaml`. ElevenLabs key is `runtime/secrets.yaml`.

| Change | File |
|---|---|
| Turn order, mic gate, say / speak / vision | `pipeline.py` |
| Quiz / preach / spectacle decks | `engagement.py` + `pipeline.py` (`_run_engagement_*`) |
| Deck copy + overlay prompts | `config.yaml` → `engagement`. Read `engagement.venue_note` before rewriting cards. Spoken card text is German. LLM replies default to German and follow the session language. |
| Empty-room session reset | `vision.absent_reset` + `vision.absent_reset_count`. Local idle captions of `NO_PERSON`. TD still uses `/ai/in/reset`. |
| Deck cursor (persists) | `runtime/engagement.json` |
| VAD capture | `audio/vad.py` |
| Whisper | `stt/whisper.py` |
| Chat | `llm/ollama.py` (lock shared with `vision/ollama.py`) |
| `{{current_goal}}` | `goals.py` |
| `{{vision}}` | `vision/observation.py` |
| NDI grab / change detect | `vision/ndi.py`, `vision/frames.py` |
| Kokoro, Piper, wav | `tts/kokoro.py` |
| ElevenLabs | `tts/elevenlabs.py` |
| OSC out / in | `osc/td_client.py`, `osc/td_server.py` (inbound dispatch: `dashboard.py` `_make_osc_handler`) |
| Levels | `metrics.py`, `audio/envelope.py` |
| Model pull / download | `models.py` |
| UI, `/api/*`, `/ws` | `dashboard.py` (`DASHBOARD_HTML` + `create_dashboard`) — Floor tab first |

Mic stream runs only while `state == "listening"`. Chat and vision never generate together (`Pipeline._ollama_lock`). Warmup is TTS, then Whisper, then chat, then vision — one GPU load at a time.
